mark, liquidez, vencimento e observações</span></summary><div class="form-grid advanced-grid"><label class="field"><span>Benchmark</span><input type="text" name="benchmark" placeholder="Ex.: CDI" maxlength="80"></label><label class="field"><span>Liquidez</span><input type="text" name="liquidity" placeholder="Ex.: D+1" maxlength="80"></label><label class="field"><span>Data de vencimento</span><input type="date" name="maturity_date"></label><label class="field"><span>Status</span><select name="status"><option value="active">Ativo</option><option value="matured">Vencido</option><option value="inactive">Inativo</option></select></label><label class="field field-wide"><span>Observações</span><textarea name="notes" rows="4" maxlength="2000" placeholder="Detalhes sobre a aplicação"></textarea></label></div></details><div class="form-actions"><a href="/investimentos" class="button button-ghost">Cancelar</a><button class="button button-primary" type="submit">Salvar aplicação</button></div></form>
